  "scientific_review": [
    "New editorial cuts61.5N[3,7]E and62.25N[3.5,8.5]E at March/June/September/December15,2022 00Z. Albretsen2012doi10.1093/icesjms/fsr187 establishes a northward low-salinity coastal wedge distinct from adjacent Atlantic flow,not these exact gates or measured depth. Enge2025doi10.3389/fmars.2025.1600994supports the existing conditionalS35 interpretation in NorwegianTrench context,not validation at our northern sections. Exact gates are our declared sampling choices.",
    "Before any field reads,both datasets have exactly paired native depth/lat/lon axes and unique matching snapshot indices/dates,40levels0-5000m including100m,instantaneous field metadata and source-specific units/frames. All8cases preflight jointly under unchanged5km/3-150profiles/20000cells-perpatch caps.",
    "One shared three-field ledger reserves velocitypairs+salinityscalars jointly:2Nnativeunits/24Nconservativebytes plus each retry scalar/8bytes,within250000units/7MB. All future first reads remain reserved. Only literalNetCDFIOfailure allows3identicalattempts after2/5seconds. Successful patches never replayed. RawHTTPwirebytes/hashes not claimed.",
    "Both native velocitycomponents and salinity are retained for every column. Original0-100m northward signed-integral selection and0.1m/s primary rule unchanged;5/10/20cm/s velocity sensitivities retained. The strongest velocitycore is selected before freshS<35 test and never replaced by a fresher neighbor. Unresolved axes or outside-class cores are not zero depth or currentabsence.",
    "Conditional fresh/component lower/upper brackets,censoring and source metadata retained. These regional2022instantaneous probes do not establish independent coastalidentity,physicalcurrentbottom,thickness,annualrange,continuousconnection to older sections,width,area orvolume. No new reference rows admitted until separate cloudreproduction.",
    "22cloudtests passed on one idleCPU before actual acquisition,covering three-field reservation,exact retry policy,success-replay prohibition,source scaling/missing metadata,all-target preflight,axis/date/unit matching,strict frozen rules andsynthetic end-to-end all8cases. No local oceanfield numerical execution.",
    "Prior referenceinventoryv12=784refs/101of111owners,modelv48,frozenregisterv48,102eddybaseline,main/runtime/queryUI/preview unchanged. Currentdepth goal remainsactive."
  ],
